enues/425"} "Palazzo dei Congressi, Roma"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/88778"} "105 from 21 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "By 1960 the core of the Italian team had been so successful for the decade was an aging one. They may have included the last three Olympic champions in " [:a {:href "/athletes/22677"} "Edoardo Mangiarotti"] ", " [:a {:href "/athletes/22658"} "Giuseppe Delfino"] ", and " [:a {:href "/athletes/22708"} "Carlo Pavesi"] " but by now they were in their late 30s and early 40s with the best of their careers behind them. Their opponents in the final were a British team who relied on the rising stars " [:a {:href "/athletes/22153"} "Allan Jay"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/22147"} "Bill Hoskyns"] " but who were a little short in depth of talent. Although Jay avenged his defeat to Delfino from the individual final he was unable to prevent the Italian team from recording a comfortable victory."] "\n\n" [:p {} "This was an Olympic swansong for Mangiarotti who bowed out of the Olympics with a career record of six gold medals amongst a record 13 medal haul which, through 2014, remains a record for a fencer. The Soviet Union placed third."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Italy"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/ITA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/ITA.png"}] "ITA"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athletes/22677"} "Edoardo Mangiarotti"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/22658"} "Giuseppe Delfino"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/22708"} "Carlo Pavesi"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/22709"} "Alberto Pellegrino"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/22682"} "Fiorenzo Marini"